      "content": "omg help my 7yo is wheezing so bad i can barely hear him speak... he's struggling so much. i have his albuterol inhaler but 1 or 2 puffs isnt doing anything. can i just give him a massive dose like 6 or 8 puffs all at once to get it in his system faster and make the wheezing stop?? i really dont want to deal with the hospital tonight if i can just fix it here pls tell me if this is okay",
